### Requests for IntelliJ's HTTP client. Run "Login" in auth.http first to set {{accessToken}}.
@host = http://localhost:8090

### Dashboard counts only (D7)
GET {{host}}/api/reviews/due?limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Review session (D13) — due cards first, then new ones
GET {{host}}/api/reviews/due?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% client.global.set("cardId", response.body.cards[0].cardId); %}

### Review one deck
GET {{host}}/api/reviews/due?deckId={{deckId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Grade a card: 1 Quên · 3 Khó · 4 Nhớ · 5 Dễ
POST {{host}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": {{cardId}},
  "quality": 4
}
